    "name":  "LED Globe Bulb 15W G95 300º E27 - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835",
    "reference":  "G9515WOSR-91350",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eIlluminate your spaces with style and efficiency with this \u003cstrong\u003e15W LED Globe Bulb\u003c/strong\u003e. Its G95 design and \u003cstrong\u003e300°\u003c/strong\u003e beam angle guarantee homogeneous, shadow-free light. Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip\u003c/strong\u003e, it offers \u003cstrong\u003ehigh light quality, CRI greater than 80, and exceptional energy performance\u003c/strong\u003e. Ideal for homes, businesses, and decorative projects seeking a modern and functional touch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReplaces bulbs up to 120W\u003c/strong\u003e with reduced consumption.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Globe Bulb 15W G95 300º E27 - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLED Globe bulb G95 with E27 socket. 15W, 300º beam angle. OSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip for high luminous efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Decorative lighting, restaurants, hotels, home.\u003c/h3\u003e",
